=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# Note$
# Glyphs mode: Figma's [+] [ ] [*] beside candidates for$
# Partial, Unknown and Not Applicable.$
# The current set is the trial set, which the maintainer$
# adopted: Partial [ ] in status.warn, Unknown [?] and Not$
# Applicable [-] in text.muted, [*] for the risk level. The$
# other sets were set aside.$
# Each list is the risk row and Figma's seven rows in all five$
# states.$
# See docs/engine/gallery-glyphs.md.$
$
  glyphs strip -------------------------------------------------$
$
  The strip compares Unicode glyphs and has no ASCII form.$
$
$

